      "content": "<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0'><tr><th style='padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Лицо</th><th style='padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Муж.р.</th><th style='padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Жен.р.</th><th style='padding:0.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Мн.ч.</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>je</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa'>mon</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa'>ma</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#60a5fa'>mes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>tu</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#34d399'>ton</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#34d399'>ta</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#34d399'>tes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>il/elle</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#c084fc'>son</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#c084fc'>sa</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#c084fc'>ses</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>nous</td><td colspan='2' style='padding:0.5rem;color:#fb923c;text-align:center'>notre</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#fb923c'>nos</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>vous</td><td colspan='2' style='padding:0.5rem;color:#f472b6;text-align:center'>votre</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#f472b6'>vos</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.5rem'>ils/elles</td><td colspan='2' style='padding:0.5rem;color:#a78bfa;text-align:center'>leur</td><td style='padding:0.5rem;color:#a78bfa'>leurs</td></tr></table><p style='padding:1rem;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);border-radius:8px'>⚠️ <strong>Важно:</strong> Перед существительными женского рода, начинающимися с гласной, используем mon/ton/son:<br>• <em>mon amie</em> (а не ma amie), <em>ton école</em> (а не ta école)</p>"
