      "title": "Les nombres 21–100 (Числа от 21 до 100)",
      "content": "<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0'><tr><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Цифра</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Слово</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Цифра</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Слово</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>21</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>vingt et un</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>60</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>soixante</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>22</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>vingt-deux</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>70</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>soixante-dix</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>30</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>trente</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>71</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>soixante et onze</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>31</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>trente et un</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>80</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>quatre-vingts</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>40</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>quarante</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>81</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>quatre-vingt-un</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>50</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>cinquante</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>90</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>quatre-vingt-dix</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>51</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>cinquante et un</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>100</td><td style='padding:0.4rem'>cent</td></tr></table><p style='padding:1rem;background:rgba(52,211,153,0.15);border-radius:8px'>⚠️ <strong>Особенности:</strong><br>• 70 = 60+10: <em>soixante-dix</em><br>• 80 = 4×20: <em>quatre-vingts</em> (с -s в конце, но quatre-vingt-un — без s)<